<title>USA: Bids for surplus US lead range $0.3784-$0.3843/lb.</title>
<headline>Bids for surplus US lead range $0.3784-$0.3843/lb.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three firms bid Thursday to buy surplus U.S. lead, with bids ranging from $0.3784 per pound to $0.3843 per pound, the Defense National Stockpile Center said.</p>
<p>American Iron and Metal Co. was high bidder, bidding $0.3843 per pound for 100 tonnes of lead.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8489</p>
</text>
